        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo mubuzuba obo, mbwaamba Jehova, kuyooba ijwi lyakulila kuMulyango wanswi, akoomoka kumunzi wabili, ajwi ipati lyakupwaya kuzilundu, ",
          "type": "text",
