        },
        {
          "text": "Lino kuciindi eco njoolangaula moonse mu-Jerusalemu amalampi, nkabela njoouma abo bantu bakede buyo mpobabede, baamba mumyoyo yabo kuti, Jehova taciti cintu niciba cibotu niciba cibi. ",
          "type": "text",
