                  "text": "Mik 6:15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Imbono zyabo ziyoosaalwa, amaanda aabo ayoonyonyoonwa. Bayooyaka maanda pele tabakooyookala mulingao, bayoobyala myuunda yamasaansa pele tabakooyoonywa waini wayo.",
          "type": "text",
