        },
        {
          "text": "Buzuba bupati bwa-Jehova buli kufwaafwi, ncobeni buli kufwaafwi, bulafwambaana loko kusika. Lilamvwigwa ijwi lyabuzuba bwa-Jehova. Mwaalumi singuzu ulalila loko kulimbubo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.1.14",
