              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buzuba obo mbuzuba bwabukali, mbuzuba bwamapenzi abwamafwabi, mbuzuba bwalupyopyongano abwalupilingano, mbuzuba bwamudima abwakusiya, mbuzuba bwamayoba busiya mbi. ",
          "type": "text",
